1
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:45,599
(Episode 14)

2
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:46,920
(This is a work of fiction.)

3
00:01:59,790 --> 00:02:02,030
This contains the truth about Shum Wai Lok's case.

4
00:02:02,910 --> 00:02:04,390
The contents are enough to convict Chan Fat.

5
00:02:05,390 --> 00:02:06,390
How did you get this?

6
00:02:07,990 --> 00:02:09,630
It just appeared at my firm out of the blue.

7
00:02:11,670 --> 00:02:13,950
Defendant Kam Yin Pan is charged with four counts.

8
00:02:14,230 --> 00:02:16,110
The first count is murder.

9
00:02:16,350 --> 00:02:17,430
The particulars of the offense state...

10
00:02:17,510 --> 00:02:19,710
that on October 22, 2025,

11
00:02:19,790 --> 00:02:21,950
in a unit at Yung Nga Terrace in Central District,

12
00:02:22,030 --> 00:02:23,830
you murdered a woman, Yau Yam Yam.

13
00:02:24,110 --> 00:02:25,150
The second count is...

14
00:02:25,230 --> 00:02:27,270
preventing the lawful burial of a body.

15
00:02:27,550 --> 00:02:28,670
The particulars of the offense state...

16
00:02:28,750 --> 00:02:30,750
that you hid the body of Yau Yam Yam...

17
00:02:30,830 --> 00:02:33,270
inside a large chest freezer.

18
00:02:33,710 --> 00:02:35,910
The third count is dangerous driving.

19
00:02:36,110 --> 00:02:37,389
The particulars state...

20
00:02:37,390 --> 00:02:39,430
that while driving a light goods vehicle...

21
00:02:39,510 --> 00:02:43,350
to transport the body of Yau Yam Yam,

22
00:02:43,430 --> 00:02:45,950
you drove said vehicle dangerously.

23
00:02:46,390 --> 00:02:49,510
The fourth count is resisting or willfully obstructing...

24
00:02:49,590 --> 00:02:52,230
a police officer in the execution of duty.

25
00:02:52,470 --> 00:02:55,870
The particulars state that when intercepted by the police,

26
00:02:55,950 --> 00:02:58,430
you drove a light goods vehicle away from the scene...

27
00:02:58,670 --> 00:03:00,790
to evade the police interception.

28
00:03:01,910 --> 00:03:02,910
Defendant,

29
00:03:03,310 --> 00:03:05,430
do you understand these four charges?

30
00:03:11,750 --> 00:03:14,550
Do you understand these four charges?

31
00:03:17,550 --> 00:03:18,550
I understand.

32
00:03:19,830 --> 00:03:20,830
Prosecution.

33
00:03:22,510 --> 00:03:23,510
Your Honor,

34
00:03:23,910 --> 00:03:25,830
the police require more time...

35
00:03:25,950 --> 00:03:28,110
to review the defendant's call records,

36
00:03:28,430 --> 00:03:30,030
take statements from relevant witnesses,

37
00:03:30,190 --> 00:03:31,590
and await the forensic reports.

38
00:03:32,350 --> 00:03:34,670
Furthermore, the victim's family has yet to sign the autopsy papers.

39
00:03:34,750 --> 00:03:36,950
- No! No autopsy! - So we haven't...

40
00:03:37,550 --> 00:03:39,230
We haven't received the autopsy report yet.

41
00:03:39,670 --> 00:03:41,110
- No autopsy! - I hope the court will grant...

42
00:03:41,190 --> 00:03:42,590
- She's not dead! - ...an eight-week adjournment.

43
00:03:42,670 --> 00:03:43,790
Yau Yam Yam isn't dead yet!

44
00:03:43,870 --> 00:03:46,030
Don't do an autopsy! If you do, she can't come back!

45
00:03:46,630 --> 00:03:48,990
Your Honor, please issue an injunction to stop the autopsy!

46
00:03:49,150 --> 00:03:50,230
Defendant, please control your emotions.

47
00:03:50,310 --> 00:03:51,310
Believe me, she's not dead!

48
00:03:51,350 --> 00:03:52,470
Yau Yam Yam isn't dead!

49
00:03:52,550 --> 00:03:54,590
- She'll wake up! - Bailiff, take him away.

50
00:03:54,710 --> 00:03:56,070
She's not dead!

51
00:03:56,150 --> 00:03:57,550
Trust me, she's not dead!

52
00:03:57,630 --> 00:03:59,630
Trust me, Amber will wake up!

53
00:03:59,710 --> 00:04:02,110
Tell them not to...

54
00:04:02,790 --> 00:04:05,590
The court is adjourned for 30 minutes.

55
00:04:06,710 --> 00:04:07,710
Court.

56
00:04:23,670 --> 00:04:24,670
- Hello. - Yes.

57
00:04:24,671 --> 00:04:25,990
I'm a reporter from "Big Island Daily".

58
00:04:26,070 --> 00:04:27,310
It's my first time covering court news.

59
00:04:27,390 --> 00:04:30,310
Can I get some information from you for my story?

60
00:04:30,590 --> 00:04:31,590
What do you want to know?

61
00:04:32,750 --> 00:04:34,350
Did that guy really kill her?

62
00:04:35,070 --> 00:04:37,830
There's circumstantial evidence and visible injuries.

63
00:04:38,030 --> 00:04:40,430
But we're not 100 percent sure if they were fatal.

64
00:04:40,910 --> 00:04:42,710
So we have to wait for the autopsy report.

65
00:04:43,230 --> 00:04:44,750
It's 99 percent certain he did it.

66
00:04:45,790 --> 00:04:47,550
Do we know his motive?

67
00:04:47,990 --> 00:04:49,710
The motive is still under investigation.

68
00:04:50,350 --> 00:04:51,830
I'd bet it's a crime of passion.

69
00:05:13,950 --> 00:05:15,270
I've scheduled the surgery for you.

70
00:05:15,590 --> 00:05:17,270
It's set for next Friday.

71
00:05:17,750 --> 00:05:20,430
The doctor said you can go home and rest for now.

72
00:05:28,750 --> 00:05:29,750
Hello.

73
00:05:30,110 --> 00:05:31,590
Are you Ms. Cheng Fong Ting?

74
00:05:33,230 --> 00:05:34,710
I'm a lawyer friend of Ms. Yau.

75
00:05:34,790 --> 00:05:35,790
My name is Lam Tung Tat.

76
00:05:36,190 --> 00:05:37,510
We worked on cases together.

77
00:05:40,390 --> 00:05:41,910
Before Ms. Yau passed away,

78
00:05:42,150 --> 00:05:43,510
she gave me this will.

79
00:05:47,150 --> 00:05:50,590
But unfortunately, before it could be officially witnessed and signed,

80
00:05:50,670 --> 00:05:51,670
she had already...

81
00:05:54,590 --> 00:05:56,790
So this will is not legally binding.

82
00:05:59,590 --> 00:06:01,390
But it's still a gesture from Amber.

83
00:06:02,470 --> 00:06:03,630
Even though it's not official,

84
00:06:05,070 --> 00:06:06,270
I still wanted you to know.

85
00:06:09,350 --> 00:06:11,310
Anyway, I'll let you get some rest.

86
00:06:12,310 --> 00:06:13,390
I wish you a speedy recovery.

87
00:06:15,350 --> 00:06:16,350
My condolences.

88
00:06:47,350 --> 00:06:48,590
I, Yau Yam Yam,

89
00:06:49,190 --> 00:06:50,910
hereby declare my will as follows.

90
00:06:51,190 --> 00:06:54,150
I declare this to be my last will and testament.

91
00:06:54,670 --> 00:06:56,150
I appoint Lam Tung Tat...

92
00:06:56,230 --> 00:06:57,550
as my estate administrator.

93
00:06:57,990 --> 00:06:59,230
My assets,

94
00:06:59,310 --> 00:07:01,550
after funeral and other expenses,

95
00:07:02,430 --> 00:07:03,950
shall be bequeathed in full...

96
00:07:04,110 --> 00:07:06,710
to my aunt, Cheng Fong Ting.

97
00:07:15,510 --> 00:07:16,510
Aunt,

98
00:07:17,630 --> 00:07:19,350
if you're reading this letter,

99
00:07:20,350 --> 00:07:21,950
it means I've passed away before you.

100
00:07:23,750 --> 00:07:25,710
This ledger records the money I owe you.

101
00:07:25,790 --> 00:07:27,270
You can compare it to yours.

102
00:07:28,030 --> 00:07:29,350
I've paid you back more than enough.

103
00:07:31,630 --> 00:07:32,670
Thank you.

104
00:07:33,910 --> 00:07:35,950
Even when my own mother didn't want me,

105
00:07:36,030 --> 00:07:37,270
you were willing to raise me.

106
00:07:38,710 --> 00:07:40,670
I know it wasn't just for the money.

107
00:07:43,390 --> 00:07:45,790
There are many things between us that are hard to explain.

108
00:07:46,870 --> 00:07:49,230
I just hope you can believe...

109
00:07:50,150 --> 00:07:53,110
that everything I did was for your own good.

110
00:07:54,750 --> 00:07:55,750
Yam Yam.

111
00:08:06,590 --> 00:08:10,989
(April 17, 2010. Aunt took me out to eat. It was yummy. 30 dollars.)

112
00:08:10,990 --> 00:08:14,949
(April 18, 2010. Breakfast bun, 5 dollars. Chocolate milk, 2.50.)

113
00:08:14,950 --> 00:08:18,030
(April 19, 2010. Aunt bought me a pretty pink skirt. 150 dollars.)

114
00:08:38,350 --> 00:08:39,910
The nurse said you're scheduled for surgery.

115
00:08:40,350 --> 00:08:41,350
What's going on?

116
00:08:42,270 --> 00:08:44,390
I... I'm really not feeling well.

117
00:08:44,710 --> 00:08:46,390
I don't think I can delay it any longer.

118
00:08:46,630 --> 00:08:47,790
The Chinese physician said...

119
00:08:47,990 --> 00:08:50,190
if you adjust your lifestyle and follow the diet therapy,

120
00:08:50,270 --> 00:08:51,710
you will get better gradually.

121
00:08:52,270 --> 00:08:53,430
You're too weak right now.

122
00:08:53,630 --> 00:08:54,990
You won't be able to handle surgery.

123
00:08:55,070 --> 00:08:56,110
I want to try.

124
00:09:00,390 --> 00:09:01,710
I know it's hard on you.

125
00:09:02,110 --> 00:09:04,590
But traditional Chinese medicine takes time.

126
00:09:05,070 --> 00:09:06,430
You can't rush it, silly.

127
00:09:12,270 --> 00:09:13,470
Think about it again, okay?

128
00:09:16,710 --> 00:09:18,270
Actually, seeing you like this...

129
00:09:18,990 --> 00:09:20,270
breaks my heart too.

130
00:09:21,110 --> 00:09:22,990
If I could take away all your pain with just the press of a button,

131
00:09:23,710 --> 00:09:25,070
I would keep it pressed forever.

132
00:09:30,270 --> 00:09:31,870
That hag said she wants surgery.

133
00:09:31,950 --> 00:09:33,950
I don't think we can wait. I need to increase the dosage.

134
00:09:34,430 --> 00:09:35,430
I'll come by to pick it up later.

135
00:09:36,790 --> 00:09:38,430
Is Cheng Fong Ting feeling better now?

136
00:09:38,510 --> 00:09:39,510
Yes, she is.

137
00:09:39,750 --> 00:09:40,790
I'd like to see her.

138
00:09:41,150 --> 00:09:42,150
Officer.

139
00:09:42,990 --> 00:09:44,030
Why are you looking for my wife?

140
00:09:45,190 --> 00:09:46,190
It's you?

141
00:09:46,630 --> 00:09:47,630
It's nothing.

142
00:09:47,750 --> 00:09:50,590
I need her to sign the autopsy document for her niece.

143
00:09:50,910 --> 00:09:51,990
Hasn't she signed it yet?

144
00:09:52,870 --> 00:09:54,910
She hasn't signed because she has been unwell.

145
00:09:54,990 --> 00:09:56,950
We can't get the autopsy report without it.

146
00:09:57,310 --> 00:09:59,710
It also delays the death certificate and funeral arrangements.

147
00:10:00,750 --> 00:10:03,510
Officer, I'm family. I'm Cheng Fong Ting's husband.

148
00:10:03,710 --> 00:10:04,870
Can I sign it?

149
00:10:06,070 --> 00:10:07,070
That works too.

150
00:10:13,830 --> 00:10:14,830
Thank you.

151
00:10:31,025 --> 00:10:33,345
You treat the netherworld like your own front door,

152
00:10:33,425 --> 00:10:34,425
coming and going as you please.

153
00:10:34,985 --> 00:10:36,665
You don't take me seriously at all.

154
00:10:36,865 --> 00:10:37,865
Great Emperor, please calm down.

155
00:10:38,065 --> 00:10:39,505
We only did this because we wanted to see you.

156
00:10:39,585 --> 00:10:41,585
In what capacity are you seeing me?

157
00:10:42,065 --> 00:10:44,385
Yau Yam Yam wants to appeal against her sentence.

158
00:10:45,105 --> 00:10:46,225
There...

159
00:10:47,145 --> 00:10:49,385
There has never been an appeal mechanism here.

160
00:10:49,465 --> 00:10:50,625
It's not in the handbook.

161
00:10:50,705 --> 00:10:51,944
It's not in the handbook,

162
00:10:51,945 --> 00:10:53,385
but that doesn't mean you can't add it.

163
00:10:53,505 --> 00:10:55,545
You're the Great Emperor. You can do whatever you want.

164
00:10:55,625 --> 00:10:56,745
You're breaking the rules knowingly,

165
00:10:56,825 --> 00:10:59,105
bringing a crowd here to disregard my judgment.

166
00:10:59,705 --> 00:11:03,065
There is only one end for those who disrespect the imperial edict.

167
00:11:06,305 --> 00:11:09,145
"There is only one end for those who disrespect the imperial edict."

168
00:11:15,905 --> 00:11:18,025
No, stop!

169
00:11:18,305 --> 00:11:19,385
Stop!

170
00:11:49,585 --> 00:11:53,425
That scumbag Chan Fat used my aunt to blackmail me!

171
00:11:54,265 --> 00:11:55,945
If I hadn't cooperated with him then,

172
00:11:56,225 --> 00:11:58,185
he would have killed my aunt!

173
00:11:58,825 --> 00:11:59,825
That's right, Emperor.

174
00:11:59,905 --> 00:12:01,665
I investigated the supplements Chan Fat gave her every day.

175
00:12:01,745 --> 00:12:03,105
I found they were all slow-acting poisons.

176
00:12:06,665 --> 00:12:08,025
Cheng Fong Ting really can't wait.

177
00:12:12,945 --> 00:12:15,505
Chan Fat did so many bad things.

178
00:12:15,585 --> 00:12:17,385
Why doesn't he have to die?

179
00:12:17,985 --> 00:12:21,145
You wouldn't act, so I had to!

180
00:12:23,105 --> 00:12:24,465
I've worked so hard.

181
00:12:25,945 --> 00:12:27,465
I've worked so hard to change.

182
00:12:29,105 --> 00:12:30,465
I'm not the person I used to be.

183
00:12:30,545 --> 00:12:32,945
Everything I did was just to save people.

184
00:12:35,665 --> 00:12:37,865
It's my fault Lok committed suicide.

185
00:12:40,025 --> 00:12:41,505
Let me pay him back with my life.

186
00:12:43,745 --> 00:12:45,265
But this really has nothing to do with King Yama.

187
00:12:45,345 --> 00:12:47,025
And you can't punish Ox Head and Horse Face.

188
00:12:47,745 --> 00:12:48,985
You dare to threaten me?

189
00:12:49,185 --> 00:12:50,585
Do you really take me for a child?

190
00:13:00,705 --> 00:13:03,585
I don't accept this. I want to appeal!

191
00:13:06,425 --> 00:13:08,305
You just won't listen, will you?

192
00:13:08,505 --> 00:13:11,385
Fine, I officially dismiss your appeal.

193
00:13:11,865 --> 00:13:13,825
Regardless of your reasons,

194
00:13:14,185 --> 00:13:16,825
Lok did commit suicide because you misled him.

195
00:13:17,385 --> 00:13:19,225
This is your karma.

196
00:13:19,905 --> 00:13:22,465
Instead of reflecting, you're unrepentant.

197
00:13:22,545 --> 00:13:24,785
I now sentence you to be reduced to fragments!

198
00:13:25,065 --> 00:13:26,225
Emperor.

199
00:13:27,785 --> 00:13:29,185
What is it now?

200
00:13:29,265 --> 00:13:30,385
A lot of ghosts are swarming outside.

201
00:13:30,465 --> 00:13:31,705
They say they must see Your Majesty on urgent business.

202
00:13:31,785 --> 00:13:32,785
See me?

203
00:13:33,425 --> 00:13:35,545
Can ordinary ghosts just see the Emperor whenever they want?

204
00:13:35,625 --> 00:13:36,785
It might be in the handbook.

205
00:13:43,065 --> 00:13:44,065
Emperor!

206
00:13:44,345 --> 00:13:46,305
- What are you doing? - Let us in!

207
00:13:48,145 --> 00:13:49,145
Emperor!

208
00:13:52,545 --> 00:13:53,545
Emperor.

209
00:13:53,865 --> 00:13:56,745
Please spare Barrister Yau and King Yama.

210
00:13:57,105 --> 00:13:58,305
If it weren't for them,

211
00:13:59,265 --> 00:14:01,985
I wouldn't have been able to leave my inheritance to Mui.

212
00:14:02,665 --> 00:14:05,785
They allowed me to die without regrets.

213
00:14:06,065 --> 00:14:07,065
Your Majesty,

214
00:14:07,545 --> 00:14:09,585
I came all the way from Australia's underworld...

215
00:14:09,945 --> 00:14:11,625
to beg you to spare Yau Yam Yam.

216
00:14:12,225 --> 00:14:15,225
Because of her, I was able to let go of my obsession.

217
00:14:16,265 --> 00:14:18,025
If it weren't for her, I would have become a malicious ghost...

218
00:14:18,105 --> 00:14:19,225
and caused many deaths.

219
00:14:19,305 --> 00:14:21,744
Your Majesty, King Yama made an exception...

220
00:14:21,745 --> 00:14:24,305
to let Barrister Yau return to life.

221
00:14:25,145 --> 00:14:26,585
It was a significant act.

222
00:14:27,105 --> 00:14:29,545
Many grudges between the dead and the living...

223
00:14:30,745 --> 00:14:33,465
really need someone like Barrister Yau...

224
00:14:33,545 --> 00:14:35,545
to help them resolve their grievances.

225
00:14:35,905 --> 00:14:38,305
Too many people leave this world with regrets.

226
00:14:39,145 --> 00:14:41,985
And many living people don't understand the feelings of the dead.

227
00:14:42,985 --> 00:14:46,345
Yau Yam Yam is the bridge between the two worlds.

228
00:14:46,905 --> 00:14:48,425
She relays the wishes of the dead.

229
00:14:48,745 --> 00:14:50,585
She has resolved many regrets and grudges.

230
00:14:50,665 --> 00:14:54,465
Where does it say that ordinary ghosts can see me?

231
00:14:54,545 --> 00:14:56,865
The handbook says that reducing malicious ghosts is your KPI.

232
00:14:57,145 --> 00:14:59,225
This proves that Yau Yam Yam has truly achieved that goal.

233
00:14:59,545 --> 00:15:01,665
Your Majesty, shouldn't you be fair with rewards and punishments?

234
00:15:02,105 --> 00:15:05,705
Even so, Yau Yam Yam's merits do not outweigh her sins.

235
00:15:06,145 --> 00:15:08,145
She can escape being reduced to fragments,

236
00:15:08,665 --> 00:15:11,865
but she must serve her sentence in the 18th level of hell.

237
00:15:12,465 --> 00:15:13,585
Wait.

238
00:15:20,625 --> 00:15:22,225
Are you helping Yau Yam Yam too?

239
00:15:22,585 --> 00:15:23,585
No.

240
00:15:24,425 --> 00:15:27,905
But there's a strange matter that has been on my mind.

241
00:15:28,865 --> 00:15:30,745
A few days ago, a young man...

242
00:15:30,825 --> 00:15:32,304
pushed a large freezer containing a corpse...

243
00:15:32,305 --> 00:15:33,665
in the middle of the night...

244
00:15:33,745 --> 00:15:34,745
and broke into Mo Man Temple.

245
00:15:35,025 --> 00:15:36,425
I investigated and found out...

246
00:15:36,505 --> 00:15:38,865
that the corpse was this woman.

247
00:15:58,785 --> 00:16:00,985
King Yama, I've done everything you said.

248
00:16:01,345 --> 00:16:03,465
I've done many good deeds and helped many people.

249
00:16:03,785 --> 00:16:05,585
Amber should have enough karma to return.

250
00:16:05,825 --> 00:16:06,985
When can she come back?

251
00:16:07,465 --> 00:16:10,425
I'm begging you.

252
00:16:17,825 --> 00:16:19,064
I know she's actually a good person.

253
00:16:19,065 --> 00:16:20,104
She's not bad at heart.

254
00:16:20,105 --> 00:16:22,625
She just doesn't know how to express herself.

255
00:16:27,265 --> 00:16:28,665
I can't live without her.

256
00:16:32,185 --> 00:16:33,705
Please give her a chance.

257
00:16:37,185 --> 00:16:38,785
Please give her a chance.

258
00:16:40,305 --> 00:16:41,665
If I can trade places with her,

259
00:16:41,745 --> 00:16:42,785
I'll do anything.

260
00:16:51,585 --> 00:16:53,745
I found this young man quite interesting.

261
00:16:53,825 --> 00:16:55,225
So I continued to investigate.

262
00:16:55,585 --> 00:16:57,465
I found out that this young man...

263
00:16:57,545 --> 00:16:59,785
has done many good deeds for this woman.

264
00:17:01,785 --> 00:17:03,465
I'm a home maintenance volunteer.

265
00:17:03,545 --> 00:17:05,345
Do you need help with any repairs at home?

266
00:17:05,705 --> 00:17:06,705
All done.

267
00:17:07,985 --> 00:17:09,985
Which church do you volunteer for?

268
00:17:10,865 --> 00:17:12,105
The Church of Amber.

269
00:17:12,225 --> 00:17:13,945
- Let me help you. - Okay.

270
00:17:14,025 --> 00:17:15,265
This is for you.

271
00:17:15,345 --> 00:17:16,345
Okay, thank you.

272
00:17:16,665 --> 00:17:18,344
Let me know if you need any help.

273
00:17:18,345 --> 00:17:19,345
I can get a social worker...

274
00:17:19,345 --> 00:17:20,345
to help you apply for public housing.

275
00:17:22,585 --> 00:17:23,905
In this day and age,

276
00:17:23,985 --> 00:17:26,705
few people value loyalty and promises.

277
00:17:27,025 --> 00:17:28,785
Yet, this young man...

278
00:17:29,025 --> 00:17:30,785
is willing to protect this woman to this extent.

279
00:17:30,865 --> 00:17:31,905
I believe...

280
00:17:32,545 --> 00:17:35,145
there is a limit to how bad she can be.

281
00:17:37,985 --> 00:17:39,585
Actually, it's not just this young man.

282
00:17:46,425 --> 00:17:47,585
Who killed her?

283
00:17:47,745 --> 00:17:48,785
Calm down first.

284
00:17:48,865 --> 00:17:50,625
Calm down, we're investigating.

285
00:17:50,705 --> 00:17:51,825
She can't just die like this.

286
00:17:51,905 --> 00:17:54,825
Who is it? Who killed her?

287
00:17:58,905 --> 00:18:00,544
Don't perform an autopsy on her! Yau Yam Yam isn't dead!

288
00:18:00,545 --> 00:18:01,945
She'll wake up!

289
00:18:02,185 --> 00:18:03,545
She's really not dead!

290
00:18:03,985 --> 00:18:05,865
- She'll wake up! - Bailiff, take him away.

291
00:18:06,265 --> 00:18:07,505
She's not dead!

292
00:18:07,585 --> 00:18:09,065
Trust me, she's not dead yet!

293
00:18:09,145 --> 00:18:11,345
Amber will wake up, trust me!

294
00:18:14,505 --> 00:18:15,825
So many people still miss her...

295
00:18:15,905 --> 00:18:17,265
and are grieving her death.

296
00:18:18,345 --> 00:18:21,105
I don't believe she's still a bad person.

297
00:18:21,905 --> 00:18:24,705
I'm sure she can help more people in the future.

298
00:18:25,305 --> 00:18:28,025
If Yau Yam Yam dies like this,

299
00:18:28,665 --> 00:18:32,185
this devoted young man will face life imprisonment.

300
00:18:34,665 --> 00:18:35,665
Your Majesty,

301
00:18:36,145 --> 00:18:38,425
we must not let such an injustice happen...

302
00:18:38,505 --> 00:18:39,945
in the mortal world.

303
00:18:45,705 --> 00:18:47,585
When Yau Yam Yam died the first time,

304
00:18:48,865 --> 00:18:51,305
I worried that this money-minded,

305
00:18:51,825 --> 00:18:53,625
offensive woman...

306
00:18:54,065 --> 00:18:56,065
who kept everyone at a distance,

307
00:18:57,105 --> 00:18:59,025
would shatter into pieces...

308
00:18:59,105 --> 00:19:00,305
because no one on earth missed her.

309
00:19:06,225 --> 00:19:08,905
Now it seems I worried for nothing.

310
00:19:13,025 --> 00:19:14,025
Thank you.

311
00:19:16,905 --> 00:19:18,465
Thank you for giving me another chance.

312
00:19:25,025 --> 00:19:26,505
What King Yama did before...

313
00:19:26,905 --> 00:19:28,625
proves that besides punishment,

314
00:19:30,225 --> 00:19:31,505
giving someone a chance...

315
00:19:32,265 --> 00:19:34,265
can lead to even greater changes.

316
00:19:36,545 --> 00:19:37,545
Your Majesty,

317
00:19:38,185 --> 00:19:39,665
why not try looking away from the handbook...

318
00:19:40,505 --> 00:19:41,665
and stop listening to us?

319
00:19:42,825 --> 00:19:44,465
Try making a decision based on your gut.

320
00:19:53,825 --> 00:19:55,265
Are the documents finally signed?

321
00:19:55,425 --> 00:19:56,425
All done.

322
00:20:25,425 --> 00:20:26,425
Hello?

323
00:20:26,865 --> 00:20:28,865
Got it. I've just started.

324
00:20:30,505 --> 00:20:31,505
Bye.

325
00:20:35,625 --> 00:20:37,185
The body is gone!

326
00:20:37,665 --> 00:20:38,665
Hey!

327
00:20:38,865 --> 00:20:41,185
What? How can it be gone?

328
00:20:41,265 --> 00:20:42,905
Was it pushed back into the cabinet?

329
00:20:42,985 --> 00:20:45,345
No, I had already started the autopsy.

330
00:20:45,425 --> 00:20:46,705
I went to answer the phone,

331
00:20:46,785 --> 00:20:48,225
and when I turned back, it was gone.

332
00:20:48,305 --> 00:20:50,065
Stop sleeping and come see for yourself.

333
00:20:50,145 --> 00:20:51,145
Hurry up.

334
00:20:55,905 --> 00:20:57,345
Are you sure it was right here?

335
00:20:59,345 --> 00:21:00,785
I had already made the first incision.

336
00:21:15,380 --> 00:21:19,780
I, Yau Yam Yam, as of October 15, 2010,

337
00:21:20,340 --> 00:21:22,260
owe Cheng Fong Ting for my upbringing.

338
00:21:22,860 --> 00:21:24,100
This is recorded in the ledger.

339
00:21:24,900 --> 00:21:26,860
I'll repay it with interest when I grow up.

340
00:21:27,100 --> 00:21:29,620
Every cent. This serves as proof.

341
00:21:30,460 --> 00:21:31,580
Yau Yam Yam.

342
00:22:23,620 --> 00:22:24,620
No appetite?

343
00:22:25,300 --> 00:22:26,300
Here, have some fruit.

344
00:22:29,220 --> 00:22:30,220
Is it sweet?

345
00:22:35,980 --> 00:22:37,060
Good. Time for your medicine.

346
00:22:41,020 --> 00:22:42,220
What medicine is this?

347
00:22:43,260 --> 00:22:45,140
I haven't seen it before.

348
00:22:46,260 --> 00:22:47,420
This is good stuff.

349
00:22:47,820 --> 00:22:49,500
You're having surgery soon,

350
00:22:49,580 --> 00:22:51,340
so you need this to boost your circulation.

351
00:22:51,700 --> 00:22:53,780
It's expensive, nearly 1,000 dollars a pill.

352
00:22:54,700 --> 00:22:55,940
Come on, it's very expensive.

353
00:23:07,700 --> 00:23:08,700
Are you okay?

354
00:23:09,580 --> 00:23:10,820
I'll let you rest.

355
00:23:34,700 --> 00:23:35,700
Coming.

356
00:23:58,500 --> 00:24:00,940
You scoundrel! Trying to poison my aunt?

357
00:24:05,380 --> 00:24:06,380
You're hitting me?

358
00:24:06,540 --> 00:24:07,660
Stop it.

359
00:24:08,380 --> 00:24:09,380
Aunt!

360
00:25:32,460 --> 00:25:33,460
Come with me.

361
00:25:52,860 --> 00:25:54,260
Where are we?

362
00:25:55,460 --> 00:25:56,460
Don't be afraid.

363
00:25:57,860 --> 00:25:58,860
Follow me.

364
00:26:06,580 --> 00:26:08,620
It's not your job to bring the dead to the netherworld.

365
00:26:08,980 --> 00:26:10,420
That's not how you use your pass.

366
00:26:10,740 --> 00:26:11,780
I was just looking for you.

367
00:26:12,860 --> 00:26:14,220
I want to give some of my life to my aunt.

368
00:26:15,500 --> 00:26:17,460
You can't just give away your lifespan.

369
00:26:17,780 --> 00:26:18,900
You just made a huge mess.

370
00:26:18,980 --> 00:26:20,340
Do you think I'll let you do that?

371
00:26:20,740 --> 00:26:21,780
Why not?

372
00:26:22,300 --> 00:26:23,820
The Emperor just reinstated you.

373
00:26:24,540 --> 00:26:26,220
I can burn plenty of offerings for you.

374
00:26:27,500 --> 00:26:29,820
I'm begging you. Help me.

375
00:26:31,100 --> 00:26:32,380
Do you want her to give her life to you?

376
00:26:36,340 --> 00:26:37,340
No.

377
00:26:39,060 --> 00:26:40,060
I want to die.

378
00:26:41,420 --> 00:26:42,420
What did you say?

379
00:26:43,260 --> 00:26:45,700
You can't die. I haven't repaid you yet.

380
00:26:45,780 --> 00:26:47,900
You've repaid me, and then some.

381
00:26:47,980 --> 00:26:50,340
- It's not enough. - It's enough.

382
00:26:51,860 --> 00:26:54,340
Hearing you say you want to give your life to me,

383
00:26:55,300 --> 00:26:56,500
that's more than enough.

384
00:26:58,820 --> 00:27:00,380
I've been neglecting myself.

385
00:27:00,980 --> 00:27:03,820
I just wanted to know how much you cared about me.

386
00:27:05,540 --> 00:27:07,420
I never intended to ignore you.

387
00:27:08,620 --> 00:27:11,140
I never meant to leave you behind. Do you understand?

388
00:27:13,020 --> 00:27:14,860
You're my only family.

389
00:27:17,180 --> 00:27:19,220
You're the one I'll miss the most.

390
00:27:22,540 --> 00:27:26,340
What have we been doing all these years?

391
00:27:29,020 --> 00:27:32,620
We wasted so much time arguing.

392
00:27:33,860 --> 00:27:37,740
We didn't cherish the time we had together.

393
00:27:40,500 --> 00:27:41,500
Now that I'm dead,

394
00:27:42,580 --> 00:27:45,020
we're finally saying all these things.

395
00:27:55,420 --> 00:27:56,500
I'm sorry.

396
00:27:58,220 --> 00:27:59,660
I'm sorry.

397
00:28:04,700 --> 00:28:06,140
I'm sorry.

398
00:28:09,220 --> 00:28:12,420
I really want to give my life to you.

399
00:28:19,900 --> 00:28:21,220
I'm so tired.

400
00:28:24,660 --> 00:28:25,700
Besides,

401
00:28:28,020 --> 00:28:30,020
this is a good way to go.

402
00:28:32,500 --> 00:28:34,500
With you here by my side.

403
00:28:36,140 --> 00:28:38,740
I won't be all alone and forgotten.

404
00:28:52,580 --> 00:28:53,900
How could I ever forget you?

405
00:28:57,340 --> 00:28:58,340
Actually, I've always...

406
00:29:00,380 --> 00:29:02,620
Actually, I've always thought of you as my mother.

407
00:29:15,260 --> 00:29:16,620
Do you have any other last wishes?

408
00:29:18,820 --> 00:29:20,020
I can help you fulfill them.

409
00:29:21,460 --> 00:29:22,540
My wish...

410
00:29:24,940 --> 00:29:26,540
You've already fulfilled it.

411
00:29:36,780 --> 00:29:37,780
It's time.

412
00:29:46,980 --> 00:29:47,980
Remember.

413
00:29:51,300 --> 00:29:52,420
Be a good person.

414
00:29:55,780 --> 00:29:59,300
You must live happily.

415
00:30:31,660 --> 00:30:33,260
I'll burn many offerings for you.

416
00:30:36,180 --> 00:30:38,060
Remember to visit me in my dreams often.

417
00:32:18,174 --> 00:32:20,294
We've heard a lot about people coming back from the dead.

418
00:32:20,374 --> 00:32:21,974
But has anyone really experienced it?

419
00:32:22,294 --> 00:32:23,974
Earlier, a female barrister in Hong Kong...

420
00:32:24,054 --> 00:32:26,134
actually came back from the dead.

421
00:32:26,454 --> 00:32:27,454
A week ago,

422
00:32:27,494 --> 00:32:30,094
our news reported on a bizarre case.

423
00:32:30,294 --> 00:32:32,694
A body was found in a freezer at Mo Man Temple.

424
00:32:33,054 --> 00:32:35,414
But even stranger things were to follow.

425
00:32:35,654 --> 00:32:38,014
A doctor had reportedly confirmed...

426
00:32:38,094 --> 00:32:40,174
that the body showed no signs of life.

427
00:32:40,374 --> 00:32:41,814
But five days later,

428
00:32:41,894 --> 00:32:45,054
the corpse could walk and came back to life.

429
00:32:45,134 --> 00:32:47,214
Was this a case of human negligence,

430
00:32:47,294 --> 00:32:48,854
or was it truly a miracle?

431
00:32:48,934 --> 00:32:51,134
Let Bubu take you for a closer look.

432
00:32:52,334 --> 00:32:54,174
This is a first in Hong Kong's medical history.

433
00:32:54,334 --> 00:32:55,854
Waking up five days after being declared dead.

434
00:32:55,934 --> 00:32:57,454
Then having no vital signs for a few minutes...

435
00:32:57,534 --> 00:32:58,694
before waking up again.

436
00:32:58,974 --> 00:33:00,654
She's definitely a subject worth studying.

437
00:33:01,334 --> 00:33:02,734
So how did you come back?

438
00:33:02,814 --> 00:33:04,054
You just opened your eyes?

439
00:33:04,134 --> 00:33:05,733
(The victim describes the sequence of events)

440
00:33:05,734 --> 00:33:08,334
I remember feeling colder and colder.

441
00:33:08,574 --> 00:33:09,574
It was bone-chilling.

442
00:33:10,334 --> 00:33:12,294
Then a force pulled me backward.

443
00:33:12,574 --> 00:33:13,854
I felt my back...

444
00:33:14,054 --> 00:33:16,534
pressed against a very cold metal surface.

445
00:33:17,374 --> 00:33:20,574
When I opened my eyes, I was lying on the autopsy table.

446
00:33:20,654 --> 00:33:21,894
The coroner had already made the first cut.

447
00:33:24,374 --> 00:33:27,254
Would you like to undergo further medical tests?

448
00:33:27,894 --> 00:33:28,894
No, thank you.

449
00:33:29,454 --> 00:33:31,374
I want to go back to a normal life...

450
00:33:32,054 --> 00:33:33,134
and enjoy my life to the fullest.

451
00:33:38,294 --> 00:33:40,974
- Counselor Yau, welcome back! - Counselor Yau, welcome back!

452
00:33:41,054 --> 00:33:42,814
You guys are so cliché.

453
00:33:42,894 --> 00:33:43,894
Master!

454
00:33:45,854 --> 00:33:47,454
I'm so glad you're okay.

455
00:33:47,814 --> 00:33:49,614
I wouldn't know what to do without you.

456
00:33:49,694 --> 00:33:51,854
I still have so much to learn from you.

457
00:33:54,054 --> 00:33:55,054
I'm sorry.

458
00:33:56,894 --> 00:33:58,014
But I can't teach you anymore.

459
00:34:02,494 --> 00:34:04,574
Because you've already graduated.

460
00:34:06,374 --> 00:34:07,694
I'll refer more cases to you in the future.

461
00:34:09,494 --> 00:34:10,573
Once you start practicing on your own...

462
00:34:10,574 --> 00:34:11,814
without a mentor watching over you,

463
00:34:12,334 --> 00:34:13,614
be careful.

464
00:34:14,454 --> 00:34:17,494
- Congratulations. - Hurry up and thank her.

465
00:34:17,894 --> 00:34:19,054
Do you want some cake?

466
00:34:19,134 --> 00:34:20,494
Let's celebrate with Counselor Yau's cake.

467
00:34:20,814 --> 00:34:22,054
We have Japanese and Korean styles.

468
00:34:22,134 --> 00:34:23,734
You're a barrister now. Eat up.

469
00:34:23,814 --> 00:34:25,734
You should eat it. There's so much cake.

470
00:34:28,414 --> 00:34:30,654
Thank you for Lok's case.

471
00:34:31,454 --> 00:34:32,454
It was the right thing to do.

472
00:34:35,734 --> 00:34:36,734
What's wrong?

473
00:34:38,494 --> 00:34:42,094
While you were gone, I thought about many "what ifs".

474
00:34:44,254 --> 00:34:46,174
But I realized that no matter what,

475
00:34:47,334 --> 00:34:49,694
I could never do what Ben did for you.

476
00:34:51,734 --> 00:34:53,014
So I'm really happy for you.

477
00:34:53,494 --> 00:34:55,294
You found someone who loves you so much.

478
00:34:57,934 --> 00:34:58,934
Thank you.

479
00:35:27,894 --> 00:35:32,654
(Niche of Cheng Fong Ting)

480
00:35:36,374 --> 00:35:40,494
(Ho Oi Yuk and Cheng Fai Cho)

481
00:35:55,534 --> 00:35:56,534
Let's swap these.

482
00:35:57,414 --> 00:36:00,734
If you see any mistakes I've made, tell me in a dream.

483
00:36:01,814 --> 00:36:02,814
I'll burn it for you.

484
00:36:28,894 --> 00:36:30,214
I found your mother.

485
00:36:36,174 --> 00:36:37,694
Are you Kam Yin Pan's mother?

486
00:36:38,574 --> 00:36:39,734
Who are you?

487
00:36:41,454 --> 00:36:42,614
I'm his girlfriend.

488
00:36:44,774 --> 00:36:46,534
That silly boy is quite something,

489
00:36:47,054 --> 00:36:48,974
finding such a beautiful girlfriend.

490
00:36:50,694 --> 00:36:52,134
But why are you here?

491
00:36:52,454 --> 00:36:53,814
Did you commit suicide too?

492
00:36:54,334 --> 00:36:56,333
- What about Ben? - No!

493
00:36:56,334 --> 00:36:58,014
Ma'am, I didn't commit suicide.

494
00:36:58,574 --> 00:36:59,774
Then why are you here?

495
00:37:00,854 --> 00:37:02,854
It's a long story.

496
00:37:04,174 --> 00:37:05,294
But that's not the point.

497
00:37:09,334 --> 00:37:11,334
Ben has always been troubled...

498
00:37:12,134 --> 00:37:13,374
by your suicide.

499
00:37:16,334 --> 00:37:17,694
He thinks you chose to end your life...

500
00:37:17,774 --> 00:37:19,414
because he wasn't good enough.

501
00:37:21,774 --> 00:37:25,214
Because of that, maybe to feel better,

502
00:37:26,374 --> 00:37:28,534
or to prevent other women from giving up,

503
00:37:30,294 --> 00:37:31,694
he goes around helping everyone.

504
00:37:34,934 --> 00:37:36,814
My death had nothing to do with him.

505
00:37:40,814 --> 00:37:42,494
If it wasn't for that silly boy,

506
00:37:43,254 --> 00:37:45,574
I think I would have died much sooner.

507
00:37:50,294 --> 00:37:53,374
After I died, I felt so much regret.

508
00:37:54,774 --> 00:37:58,614
I missed him and wanted to see him so much.

509
00:38:00,414 --> 00:38:02,133
But it turns out those who commit suicide...

510
00:38:02,134 --> 00:38:04,334
are kept locked up here.

511
00:38:05,174 --> 00:38:07,814
I can't even reach him in a dream.

512
00:38:13,774 --> 00:38:15,774
If you have anything to say to him, tell me.

513
00:38:16,894 --> 00:38:17,894
I'll pass the message to him for you.

514
00:38:26,094 --> 00:38:27,734
Please tell him for me.

515
00:38:30,454 --> 00:38:35,374
When I was alive,

516
00:38:36,854 --> 00:38:40,534
he was the only reason I could keep going.

517
00:38:46,254 --> 00:38:50,054
I loved him so much that I couldn't bear to leave him.

518
00:38:50,614 --> 00:38:53,134
That's why I wanted to take him with me.

519
00:38:55,494 --> 00:38:57,654
He did nothing wrong. It was all my fault.

520
00:39:01,574 --> 00:39:03,414
If I could choose again,

521
00:39:05,014 --> 00:39:07,574
I definitely wouldn't commit suicide.

522
00:39:09,614 --> 00:39:13,814
I really wanted to stay by Ben's side.

523
00:39:20,054 --> 00:39:21,334
Please tell him for me.

524
00:39:23,734 --> 00:39:27,214
Tell him to live a good life.

525
00:39:28,734 --> 00:39:30,774
He must be happy.

526
00:39:32,854 --> 00:39:38,814
He'll always be my good, beloved son.

527
00:39:47,374 --> 00:39:48,374
Thank you.

528
00:40:06,774 --> 00:40:07,854
Shum Wai Lok,

529
00:40:08,654 --> 00:40:11,534
Yau Yam Yam is willing to give her remaining years to you.

530
00:40:12,534 --> 00:40:15,414
But your body has been cremated, so you can't return to it.

531
00:40:16,094 --> 00:40:18,414
So I'm granting you an express reincarnation pass.

532
00:40:18,774 --> 00:40:21,974
The years she gave you will be added to your next life.

533
00:40:23,454 --> 00:40:25,054
If she gives her remaining years to me,

534
00:40:25,894 --> 00:40:27,294
won't she die very soon then?

535
00:40:29,254 --> 00:40:31,494
Don't worry, she has her ways.

536
00:40:39,774 --> 00:40:40,934
Good morning, everyone.

537
00:40:42,734 --> 00:40:43,734
Good morning.

538
00:40:44,014 --> 00:40:45,014
What's the plan for today?

539
00:40:45,414 --> 00:40:47,414
It's a busy day. I have meetings all day.

540
00:40:48,414 --> 00:40:49,734
Then I'll head to the garage this afternoon.

541
00:40:49,814 --> 00:40:51,254
